0..77 Comment "// What a kept view may not do: a view no region keeps escapes its access, an"
78..155 Comment "// exclusive view is kept nowhere, a held value a live region keeps a view of"
156..235 Comment "// is not written, and nothing kept in a region leaves it. A region is a static"
236..314 Comment "// extent erased before anything runs (Koronkevich and Bowman, _Type Universes"
315..369 Comment "// as Kripke Worlds_, ICFP 2025, doi:10.1145/3747532)."
